Zangron Lee is a large man whose eyes are blue throughout, with no white to them. He wears a headpiece of lion-head gold medals that hang to his knees, and carries a flail. He keeps a small book of battle and philosophy close, and says he was born ready to fight.

Zangron is a high-ranking delving specialist of [[Org/The Scale/index|The Scale]], sent with three others to a Joker World at [[Geography/Star 221,325|Star 221,325]].
